      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "踏踏实实、稳扎稳打。为了这样不断积累，\n重要的是『持续力』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7853ebed94bae07ed50e16afb26c940c1e3bccf1565f818402f345c7801d5941",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
