      "uid": "zhcn:dc9a4e44c97028e2bc99d2d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而为了『持续』，\n有时主动『停下』也同样重要。\n这样才不会在不希望的时候『被迫停下』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbac7280bc550c96dd8eae0ceaba410c80e1cf62cb43e49df252311bab992895",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111303.json",
      "json_path": [
