      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9358e2ab8bb6c5d815d935a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量与勇敢之心，还有西沙里奥。\n她们同年级，同班\n彼此关系也很要好――",
      "source_fingerprint": "44fc6b471f8fc85d4e0c9f5a673c5b244e8bf38b45936141f376165ecf4b87a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62b7eea96c4940e5d60148a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而一旦她们就这样同期出道，她们便会\n成为争夺“三后冠”这份独一无二荣耀的，\n彼此互为劲敌的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aced2b2609a8542a8eba24d1af1d2a88e4054553cd5c4d410f0100dd0170920",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111303.json",
      "json_path": [
