        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0c1d87ac425c7f13b8d0a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。她们，和空中救世主一样，\n都想要夺取那顶美丽的桂冠――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74f0397abcccc75b7bd3789e1735f1a803cb94f95c813744a72c0c510f4245b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
